{"data": [{"author_id": "2445528445", "created_at": "2026-11-10T19:02:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120230759151616393"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 225, "start": 218, "tag": "CRISPR"}, {"end": 242, "start": 226, "tag": "geneticdiseases"}, {"end": 255, "start": 243, "tag": "cholesterol"}], "mentions": [{"end": 217, "id": "172496840", "start": 203, "username": "EliLillyandCo"}], "urls": [{"description": "A single dose of CRISPR base editing durably lowered ANGPTL3 in primates, offering a potential new approach to treating high cholesterol.", "display_url": "hubs.li/Q04DTsfq0", "end": 279, "expanded_url": "https://hubs.li/Q04DTsfq0", "images": [{"height": 483, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120230767485767680/90MYgJeA?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 724}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120230767485767680/90MYgJeA?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 256, "status": 200, "title": "One-Time CRISPR Gene Editing Shows Lasting Cholesterol Reduction", "unwound_url": "https://www.insideprecisionmedicine.com/topics/translational-research/one-time-crispr-gene-editing-shows-lasting-cholesterol-reduction/?utm_campaign=41123470-IPM_Editorial%20Social&utm_content=389592144&utm_medium=social&utm_source=twitter&hss_channel=tw-2445528445", "url": "https://t.co/wizm3fqvWe"}]}, "id": "2120230759151616393", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 108, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "One-Time CRISPR Gene Editing Shows Lasting Cholesterol Reduction\n\nA single dose of CRISPR base editing durably lowered ANGPTL3 in primates, offering a potential new approach to treating high cholesterol\n@EliLillyandCo\n#CRISPR #geneticdiseases #cholesterol\nhttps://t.co/wizm3fqvWe", "url": "https://x.com/Inside_PM/status/2120230759151616393"}, {"article": {"title": "Prime Editing 現況對比：與 CAR-T、CRISPR-Cas9 的差異與應用"}, "author_id": "1589485943446126592", "created_at": "2026-11-10T10:40:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120104212122173574"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/i/article/2120…", "end": 23, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2120103013914497024", "start": 0, "status": 404, "unwound_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2120103013914497024", "url": "https://t.co/k7RQbxupeq"}]}, "id": "2120104212122173574", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 183, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/k7RQbxupeq", "url": "https://x.com/talkmang/status/2120104212122173574"}, {"author_id": "1986901942216630272", "created_at": "2026-11-09T12:09:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119764324524683423"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 28, "start": 23, "tag": "PRME"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/rc6cWs7yyE", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/seahorse_anton/status/2119764324524683423/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119764267939344385", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/rc6cWs7yyE"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/rc6cWs7yyE", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/seahorse_anton/status/2119764324524683423/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119764267884834816", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/rc6cWs7yyE"}]}, "id": "2119764324524683423", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 695, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Prime Medicine, Inc. ( $PRME ) – $4.65 | Nov 9, 2026\nClinical-stage biotechnology pioneer developing one-time curative genetic therapies via novel Prime Editing technology (search-and-replace gene editing platform) for rare hematologic, liver, neurological, and ocular diseases https://t.co/rc6cWs7yyE", "url": "https://x.com/seahorse_anton/status/2119764324524683423"}, {"author_id": "2801692272", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:31:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120147432600199256"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 5, "start": 0, "tag": "PRME"}]}, "id": "2120147432600199256", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 840, "like_count": 16, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "$PRME I don't recall seeing this, so it's old but worth looking into for future expectations. It also shows more and more people are using prime editing.\n\nNature, published 22 April 2026.\n\nFrom the abstract: \"Although prime editing using paired guide RNAs (pegRNAs) can mediate", "url": "https://x.com/LordHodler/status/2120147432600199256"}, {"author_id": "35789155", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:01:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120139730398691675"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 87, "start": 82, "tag": "BEAM"}], "urls": [{"description": "Beam Therapeutics expects to file for FDA approval of its one-time treatment for patients with sickle cell disease (SCD) by the end of the year after announcing Tuesday that a Phase I/II study met its primary endpoint. \"These positive top-line results represent a defining milestone for [ristoglogene autogetemcel (risto-cel)] and for Beam's base editing technology more broadly,\" remarked CEO John Evans. Risto-cel, formerly known as BEAM-101, is a genetically modified cell therapy that consists of autologous", "display_url": "firstwordpharma.com/story/8397433", "end": 111, "expanded_url": "https://firstwordpharma.com/story/8397433", "images": [{"height": 373, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120139734932754432/rTKV4RSl?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 560}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120139734932754432/rTKV4RSl?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 88, "status": 200, "title": "Beam's base-editing therapy risto-cel hits main goal of pivotal sickle cell study", "unwound_url": "https://firstwordpharma.com/story/8397433", "url": "https://t.co/7Pc8MNkteH"}]}, "id": "2120139730398691675", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 935, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Beam's base-editing therapy risto-cel hits main goal of pivotal sickle cell study $BEAM https://t.co/7Pc8MNkteH", "url": "https://x.com/fwpharma/status/2120139730398691675"}, {"author_id": "1564125781", "created_at": "2026-11-10T17:34:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120208440186622235"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 100, "start": 95, "tag": "BEAM"}], "mentions": [{"end": 114, "id": "960747870", "start": 101, "username": "ByJonGardner"}], "urls": [{"description": "The result represents a scientific milestone and positions Beam to submit a first-of-its-kind FDA application as soon as the end of the year.", "display_url": "biopharmadive.com/news/beam-sick…", "end": 94, "expanded_url": "https://www.biopharmadive.com/news/beam-sickle-cell-base-editing-risto-cel-results/874242/", "images": [{"height": 380, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120204382314856448/rJZ7DKli?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 770}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120204382314856448/rJZ7DKli?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 71, "status": 200, "title": "Beam’s base editing therapy for sickle cell hits goal in pivotal trial", "unwound_url": "https://www.biopharmadive.com/news/beam-sickle-cell-base-editing-risto-cel-results/874242/", "url": "https://t.co/LE1nZvXyZ3"}]}, "id": "2120208440186622235", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 424, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Beam’s base editing therapy for sickle cell hits goal in pivotal trial https://t.co/LE1nZvXyZ3 $BEAM @ByJonGardner", "url": "https://x.com/BioPharmaDive/status/2120208440186622235"}, {"author_id": "1144870085422530560", "created_at": "2026-11-09T12:12:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119764990941098417"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 187, "start": 166, "tag": "PrimeEditingAdvances"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/bh3MtfYQJ3", "end": 250, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/BioDesignR/status/2119764990941098417/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119764976110092288", "start": 227, "url": "https://t.co/bh3MtfYQJ3"}]}, "id": "2119764990941098417", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 556, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Three DSB-free, recombinase-independent prime editing platforms (QuadPE, PA, PRIME-In) achieve up to 26 kb targeted large DNA insertion, outperforming existing tools #PrimeEditingAdvances \nDetails: 10.1016/j.bidere.2026.100126 https://t.co/bh3MtfYQJ3", "url": "https://x.com/BioDesignR/status/2119764990941098417"}, {"author_id": "1330055544", "created_at": "2026-11-10T17:18:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120204376082092314"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 114, "start": 109, "tag": "BEAM"}, {"end": 120, "start": 115, "tag": "VRTX"}, {"end": 126, "start": 121, "tag": "CRSP"}], "mentions": [{"end": 108, "id": "960747870", "start": 95, "username": "ByJonGardner"}], "urls": [{"description": "The result represents a scientific milestone and positions Beam to submit a first-of-its-kind FDA application as soon as the end of the year.", "display_url": "biopharmadive.com/news/beam-sick…", "end": 94, "expanded_url": "https://www.biopharmadive.com/news/beam-sickle-cell-base-editing-risto-cel-results/874242/", "images": [{"height": 380, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120204382314856448/rJZ7DKli?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 770}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120204382314856448/rJZ7DKli?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 71, "status": 200, "title": "Beam’s base editing therapy for sickle cell hits goal in pivotal trial", "unwound_url": "https://www.biopharmadive.com/news/beam-sickle-cell-base-editing-risto-cel-results/874242/", "url": "https://t.co/HkGclgkjhv"}]}, "id": "2120204376082092314", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 640, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Beam’s base editing therapy for sickle cell hits goal in pivotal trial https://t.co/HkGclgkjhv @ByJonGardner $BEAM $VRTX $CRSP", "url": "https://x.com/BentheFidler/status/2120204376082092314"}, {"author_id": "425720234", "created_at": "2026-11-09T10:48:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119743940395999409"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/0CAX8ejFRt", "end": 258, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/annameldolesi/status/2119743940395999409/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119743756891037696", "start": 235, "url": "https://t.co/0CAX8ejFRt"}]}, "id": "2119743940395999409", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 62, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Gli Usa stanno discutendo regole semplificate per la commercializzazione delle terapie basate sull'editing di precisione (editing di basi e prime editing). Ne ho scritto su Osservatorio Terapie Avanzate (link a seguire, senza paywall) https://t.co/0CAX8ejFRt", "url": "https://x.com/annameldolesi/status/2119743940395999409"}, {"author_id": "3407436940", "created_at": "2026-11-09T21:05:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119899132152123836"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Key PointsPrime editing enables immunosuppression-resistant genetic, antigen-specific, and CAR T-cell therapies.Edited T cells are controllable in vivo usi", "display_url": "ow.ly/ay1h5104eE3", "end": 275, "expanded_url": "https://ow.ly/ay1h5104eE3", "images": [{"height": 685, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2118530755878080512/BpZ_qk5e?format=png&name=orig", "width": 520}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2118530755878080512/BpZ_qk5e?format=png&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 252, "status": 200, "title": "Prime editing enables drug-controllable T-cell therapies with clinical immunosuppression", "unwound_url": "https://ashpublications.org/blood/article/148/19/2354/569935/Prime-editing-enables-drug-controllable-T-cell?utm_source=twitter&utm_campaign=2026_qiti&utm_medium=organic_social", "url": "https://t.co/DkkEfFLzBr"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/tz7AwH8qBr", "end": 299, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/BloodPortfolio/status/2119899132152123836/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119899130130485248", "start": 276, "url": "https://t.co/tz7AwH8qBr"}]}, "id": "2119899132152123836", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 10, "impression_count": 3381, "like_count": 23, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "Prime editing enables immunosuppression-resistant genetic, antigen-specific, and CAR T-cell therapies. Edited T cells are controllable in vivo using common immunosuppressants with minimal perturbation of T-cell biology. Read the full article in Blood: https://t.co/DkkEfFLzBr https://t.co/tz7AwH8qBr", "url": "https://x.com/BloodPortfolio/status/2119899132152123836"}, {"author_id": "1869735207978295296", "created_at": "2026-11-10T15:12:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120172839328432404"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/adamfeuerstein…", "end": 214, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/adamfeuerstein/status/2120125396037583217", "start": 191, "url": "https://t.co/BooYJgt9lT"}]}, "id": "2120172839328432404", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 140, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120125396037583217", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "The detail I'd watch: 31 patients had completed the 12-month follow-up at this cutoff, and Beam says a BLA could go in as early as year-end, potentially the first for a base editing therapy. https://t.co/BooYJgt9lT", "url": "https://x.com/buzztickr/status/2120172839328432404"}, {"author_id": "3011950018", "created_at": "2026-11-09T11:49:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119759207419285777"], "id": "2119759207419285777", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 144, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "October's Industry updates from Dusko Ilic have landed! Get caught up on the latest developments, including:\n\n💬Prime editing reaches the liver in Wilson disease\n💬Two priority review vouchers worth US$413 million\n💬All 28 patients in a pivotal β-thalassemia cohort stopped", "url": "https://x.com/RegMedNet/status/2119759207419285777"}, {"author_id": "1677076957908066305", "created_at": "2026-11-10T09:02:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120079760189751719"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 236, "start": 224, "tag": "Epigenetics"}, {"end": 247, "start": 237, "tag": "Chromatin"}], "mentions": [{"end": 184, "id": "984673911789977600", "start": 172, "username": "mafvg_mafvg"}, {"end": 222, "id": "1345385060", "start": 208, "username": "MolecularCell"}], "urls": [{"description": "Wang, Zittersteijn et al. show that the chromatin landscape of a target sequence is a key determinant of DSB-free genome-editing outcomes. Strikingly, while heterochromatin often impairs prime editing, it can enhance base editing and additionally control the fidelity and purity of the DNA modification products generated.", "display_url": "cell.com/molecular-cell…", "end": 170, "expanded_url": "https://www.cell.com/molecular-cell/abstract/S1097-2765(26)00717-3", "images": [{"height": 375, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117737904881688576/tNbNs5ob?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 375}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117737904881688576/tNbNs5ob?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 147, "status": 200, "title": "The chromatin context differently impacts prime editors and base editors and controls the fidelity and purity of base editing", "unwound_url": "https://www.cell.com/molecular-cell/abstract/S1097-2765(26)00717-3", "url": "https://t.co/EDD69LITfl"}, {"description": "Quantitative chromatin profiling technologies and services for translational research teams", "display_url": "epigenometech.com", "end": 276, "expanded_url": "https://epigenometech.com", "start": 253, "status": 200, "title": "Epigenome Technologies", "unwound_url": "https://epigenometech.com", "url": "https://t.co/WmSYDGXnzb"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/jepVBcUpNI", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/EpigenomeTech/status/2120079760189751719/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120079674046926848", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/jepVBcUpNI"}]}, "id": "2120079760189751719", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 313, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Epigenetics Update - The chromatin context differently impacts prime editors and base editors and controls the fidelity and purity of base editing https://t.co/EDD69LITfl\n\n@mafvg_mafvg (Leiden University) in @MolecularCell\n\n#Epigenetics #Chromatin\n---\n\nhttps://t.co/WmSYDGXnzb https://t.co/jepVBcUpNI", "url": "https://x.com/EpigenomeTech/status/2120079760189751719"}, {"author_id": "1572818562036957185", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:33:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120147904887451838"], "id": "2120147904887451838", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 332, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The most valuable in the PR is the safety profile. For base editing, the biggest fear is “leukemogenesis caused by off-target effects” or “unknown genotoxicity.” In this trial, Beam’s base editor has not triggered any unexpected genotoxicity red flags in humans.$Beam", "url": "https://x.com/Vincent15101/status/2120147904887451838"}, {"author_id": "50076223", "created_at": "2026-11-10T19:11:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120232776909688845"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/PshdRk2aJw", "end": 295, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/RevvityLifeSci/status/2120232776909688845/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119924411629187072", "start": 272, "url": "https://t.co/PshdRk2aJw"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/PshdRk2aJw", "end": 295, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/RevvityLifeSci/status/2120232776909688845/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119924422479953920", "start": 272, "url": "https://t.co/PshdRk2aJw"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/PshdRk2aJw", "end": 295, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/RevvityLifeSci/status/2120232776909688845/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119924433695485952", "start": 272, "url": "https://t.co/PshdRk2aJw"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/PshdRk2aJw", "end": 295, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/RevvityLifeSci/status/2120232776909688845/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119924444827197440", "start": 272, "url": "https://t.co/PshdRk2aJw"}]}, "id": "2120232776909688845", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 32, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "We’re excited to share new data demonstrating high-efficiency in vivo editing with the Pin-point™ base editing platform following LNP delivery at modest total RNA doses [link], performing with editing levels within the range reported for established and optimized ABE LNP https://t.co/PshdRk2aJw", "url": "https://x.com/RevvityLifeSci/status/2120232776909688845"}, {"author_id": "1556815411332759552", "created_at": "2026-11-10T07:36:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120057874525381084"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/fqwjc7RZA3", "end": 286, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/YinfengLife/status/2120057874525381084/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120057865193025538", "start": 263, "url": "https://t.co/fqwjc7RZA3"}]}, "id": "2120057874525381084", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 30, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A human first: prime editing has rewritten DNA inside a patient's body. Prime Medicine treated the first Wilson disease patient, fixing the copper-processing gene in liver cells — no cell removal, no chemo. In vivo gene editing just went from theory to clinic. 🧬 https://t.co/fqwjc7RZA3", "url": "https://x.com/YinfengLife/status/2120057874525381084"}, {"author_id": "1832077594923012096", "created_at": "2026-11-10T19:15:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120233942859014158"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/UmLVSUXPvd", "end": 289, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/allsci_corp/status/2120233942859014158/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120233941294530560", "start": 266, "url": "https://t.co/UmLVSUXPvd"}]}, "id": "2120233942859014158", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Beam Therapeutics' risto-cel hits primary endpoint in pivotal sickle cell trial — all 31 evaluable patients cleared 12 months free of severe vaso-occlusive crises. BLA filing on track for year-end 2026, potentially the first base-editing therapy approved in the US. https://t.co/UmLVSUXPvd", "url": "https://x.com/allsci_corp/status/2120233942859014158"}, {"author_id": "1786949678539710464", "created_at": "2026-11-09T20:16:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119886944071254050"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 32, "start": 27, "tag": "PRME"}], "mentions": [{"end": 24, "id": "1640879370171568128", "start": 10, "username": "techinvestoor"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/techinvestoor/…", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/techinvestoor/status/2119849949148140026", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/enGsxBXEkv"}]}, "id": "2119886944071254050", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1307, "like_count": 17, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119849949148140026", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Well said @techinvestoor \n\n$PRME advances prime editing, capable of correcting ~90% of pathogenic mutations. PERT enables one editor to treat many nonsense-mutation diseases (~24–30% of rare genetic cases), cutting development costs by tens to hundreds of millions per disease. https://t.co/enGsxBXEkv", "url": "https://x.com/jimmyrixx/status/2119886944071254050"}, {"author_id": "1498030353642053632", "created_at": "2026-11-10T17:34:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120208581723386129"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Today, we’re making Gemini 4 Carbon available to developers, enterprises, scientists, and consumers.", "display_url": "blog.google/innovation-and…", "end": 186, "expanded_url": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/models-and-research/gemini-models/gemini-4-carbon-now-available/", "images": [{"height": 731, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120185696329830400/e8poSpUk?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1300}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120185696329830400/e8poSpUk?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 163, "status": 200, "title": "Gemini 4 Carbon is now available", "unwound_url": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/models-and-research/gemini-models/gemini-4-carbon-now-available/", "url": "https://t.co/6azojZloLU"}]}, "id": "2120208581723386129", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 141, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🔥 Hot updates! \n\n- Gemini 4 Carbon ships [AI] Google's strongest model, aimed at cybersecurity and long-running agent work, now in the API and Gemini app. Google: https://t.co/6azojZloLU\n\n- Claude Fable 5.2 and Mythos 5.2 [AI] Anthropic's new models target hard coding and", "url": "https://x.com/hold_fi/status/2120208581723386129"}, {"author_id": "222697725", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:00:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120139410943443243"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/john_evans3/st…", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/john_evans3/status/2120128412928836028", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/50EEjmmaYt"}]}, "id": "2120139410943443243", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120128412928836028", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "When most people talking about Fable 5.2 today, Beam just announced their milestone on using base editor to treat sickle cell disease. \nA total of 39 adults and 10 adolescents were treated in the BEACON trial, and 31 patients had completed the required follow-up period for at https://t.co/50EEjmmaYt", "url": "https://x.com/younghope11/status/2120139410943443243"}, {"author_id": "1247994699425726467", "created_at": "2026-11-10T05:32:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120026850218917934"], "id": "2120026850218917934", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 9, "impression_count": 1152, "like_count": 23, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "What if immunosuppressive drugs could become tools to control therapeutic T cells rather than simply suppress them?\n\nA major challenge in cell and gene therapy is the lack of clinically practical ways to selectively expand or eliminate engineered cells inside the body. This", "url": "https://x.com/YLeyfman/status/2120026850218917934"}, {"author_id": "4925827408", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:40:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120149608659653017"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 5, "start": 0, "tag": "BEAM"}]}, "id": "2120149608659653017", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 91, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "$BEAM announces positive topline pivotal data from BEACON Phase 1/2 of risto-cel (base-edited autologous CD34+ HSPCs) in severe SCD.\n✅ Primary endpoint met: VF12 (freedom from severe VOCs ≥12 consecutive months, independently adjudicated)\n✅ All primary safety + secondary", "url": "https://x.com/Bioupdatesdaily/status/2120149608659653017"}, {"author_id": "1993322019698753537", "created_at": "2026-11-10T08:09:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120066235845214286"], "id": "2120066235845214286", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "自CRISPR问世以来，人类基因组编辑始终被困在一种“剪刀与胶水”的被动隐喻中。Cas9等核酸酶本质上只是可编程的分子剪刀：它们负责切断双链DNA，而后续的修复、敲除或外源片段插入，则完全听凭宿主细胞自身的修复机制（NHEJ或HDR）摆布。在成年神经元、心肌细胞及造血干细胞等非分裂细胞中，同源重组修复", "url": "https://x.com/lifescienceX/status/2120066235845214286"}, {"author_id": "2087319928055758848", "created_at": "2026-11-09T05:29:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119663723447033871"], "id": "2119663723447033871", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Headline radar — Monday, Nov 9\nWhat crossed the wire today, as other outlets reported it — not yet independently verified by us. The stories we pick up get full reporting here.\n\n• Nvidia said it will investigate reports Chinese intelligence targeted CEO Jensen Huang through a", "url": "https://x.com/ohmegamonster/status/2119663723447033871"}, {"author_id": "818008252814217217", "created_at": "2026-11-08T21:10:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119537946663727450"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 229, "start": 222, "tag": "CRISPR"}], "urls": [{"description": "Abstract. Defined DNA lesions are essential substrates for dissecting DNA repair mechanisms, yet existing approaches remain limited in positional flexibili", "display_url": "doi.org/10.1093/nar/gk…", "end": 214, "expanded_url": "https://doi.org/10.1093/nar/gkag965", "images": [{"height": 221, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119537956096815104/o7PZwYEM?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 520}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119537956096815104/o7PZwYEM?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 191, "status": 200, "title": "CRISPR-mediated gap-based replacement enables site-specific DNA lesion insertion into long DNA and nucleosomes", "unwound_url": "https://academic.oup.com/